  "_comment": "Single source of truth for the Honua.Server.Tests shard matrix. Owned by ADR-0037. Each entry under `shards` carries both routing fields (`paths`) and matrix-runtime fields (`shard_name`, `artifact_suffix`, `log_name`, `timeout_minutes`, `max_cpu_count`, `upload_operator_eval_report`, `upload_odata_evidence`, `filter`). The `targeted-shards` job in ci.yml reads this file, runs scripts/ci/honua-server-targeted-tests.sh to pick the active shards for the diff, and emits a filtered `matrix_include` that ci.yml::server-tests consumes via `strategy.matrix.include: fromJson(...)`. `infrastructure_paths` short-circuits to run_all on first match. `unmapped_source_run_all_prefixes` forces run_all when a changed file under one of those prefixes is not matched by any shard's `paths` — this prevents new feature directories from silently routing to the Core shard whose filter excludes Honua.Server.Tests.Features.*. `default_shards_when_no_match` is only consulted when no source code under those prefixes was touched (e.g. doc-only diffs).",
